Open Router0 → **CLI** tab, press Enter, then paste this:

```
enable
configure terminal
interface g0/0
 ip address 10.0.1.1 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
interface g0/1
 ip address 10.0.3.1 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
interface g0/2
 ip address 192.168.0.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
exit
router ospf 1
 network 10.0.1.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.0.3.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 192.168.0.0 0.0.0.255 area 0
end
write memory
```

Check it with `show ip interface brief`.

Later, for the cost test, add:
```
configure terminal
interface g0/0
 ip ospf cost 100
end
```
